---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Cookie Policy — TH Homes" description="How TH Homes uses cookies and similar browser storage.">
  <section class="page-hero legal-hero"><div class="page-hero-inner"><h1>Cookie choices that stay yours.</h1><p>What this website stores in your browser, why it is needed and how you can change your choice.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><article class="section-inner legal-copy">
    <p class="legal-updated">Last reviewed: 23 November 2026</p>
    <h2>What we use</h2><p>This website uses browser storage to remember your cookie choice and colour-theme preference. These items support essential functionality and accessibility. Optional analytics are off unless you choose “Accept analytics”. No advertising cookies are currently used.</p>
    <div class="cookie-table" role="region" aria-label="Cookie and storage details" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th>Item</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Type</th><th>Duration</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>thhomes-cookie-preference</td><td>Remembers essential-only or analytics consent</td><td>Essential local storage</td><td>Until cleared</td></tr><tr><td>thhomes-theme</td><td>Remembers light or dark appearance</td><td>Essential preference</td><td>Until cleared</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
    <h2>Your choice</h2><p>Under the Nigeria Data Protection Act 2023 and the Nigeria Data Protection Commission’s General Application and Implementation Directive, non-essential cookies and tracking tools require a freely given, informed and specific choice. Rejecting optional analytics does not prevent you from using this website.</p>
    <p><button class="text-link legal-settings-button" type="button" data-cookie-settings>Review cookie settings</button></p>
    <h2>Browser controls</h2><p>You can also remove stored preferences in your browser settings. Clearing site data will cause the consent notice and theme preference to appear again. If optional analytics are added before launch, this page must be updated with the provider, purpose, data collected, duration and any international transfer details before those tools are enabled.</p>
  </article></section>
</BaseLayout>
